    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Glitch Party is a party game for 2-8 players online. Challenge your friends in different minigames, each with a small chance of being glitched. Welcome to Glitch Party!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2270230/extras/df9e8dfd78299463e499f3e72f4ba840.poster.avif?t=1749497154\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2270230/extras/df9e8dfd78299463e499f3e72f4ba840.webm?t=1749497154\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2270230/extras/df9e8dfd78299463e499f3e72f4ba840.mp4?t=1749497154\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minigames</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Comepete in varius diffrent minigames. Racing, fighting, strategic competitions, last to survive, and many others. Powered by Unreal Engine 5 you get beautiful maps, physics, and lighting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Glitched Version</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each minigame has a small chance of spawning as a glitched version. With increased points, more action, and different twists, it spices things up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Modes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose amount of minigames to compete in and the probability to get the glitched version.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Characters</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose between 8 different characters each with their own voice. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Development</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Glitch Party is made by Gyllensten Games, a solo developer game studio creating its first game.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Glitch Party is a party game for 2-8 players online. Challenge your friends in different minigames, each with a small chance of being glitched. Welcome to Glitch Party!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2270230/extras/df9e8dfd78299463e499f3e72f4ba840.poster.avif?t=1749497154\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2270230/extras/df9e8dfd78299463e499f3e72f4ba840.webm?t=1749497154\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2270230/extras/df9e8dfd78299463e499f3e72f4ba840.mp4?t=1749497154\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minigames</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Comepete in varius diffrent minigames. Racing, fighting, strategic competitions, last to survive, and many others. Powered by Unreal Engine 5 you get beautiful maps, physics, and lighting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Glitched Version</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each minigame has a small chance of spawning as a glitched version. With increased points, more action, and different twists, it spices things up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Modes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose amount of minigames to compete in and the probability to get the glitched version.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Characters</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose between 8 different characters each with their own voice. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Development</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Glitch Party is made by Gyllensten Games, a solo developer game studio creating its first game.</p>",
